Package: mcwutils
Type: Package
Title: Small Utilities for Biostatistical Data Management and Reporting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Aniko", "Szabo", email = "aszabo@mcw.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of small helper functions for routine data
    preparation in biostatistical projects: tracking participant exclusions in
    a selection flow table, handling strings with missing values, summarizing
    vectors that may be entirely missing, converting laboratory values reported
    as below the limit of detection, administrative censoring of time-to-event
    data, working with REDCap-style data dictionaries, and sourcing scripts or
    R Markdown files.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: dplyr, knitr, rlang, stringi, stringr, tibble
Suggests: gt, janitor, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
